// Maren Coyle's conversations (ticket 0014): the arrivals warden of the
// nearest assembly, on the quay. Warm, quick, practical, a little tired, and
// proud of her city. She opens the questline, can end it at once for a
// household that has done this before, and is one of the three it can end
// with.
(
    version: 1,
    nodes: [
        (id: "maren.welcome", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Maren Coyle, arrivals warden for {assembly}. You'll be the household off the morning boat. Let's get you settled before the next one docks.",
         replies: [
            (text: "That's us. Where do we start?",
             effects: [StartQuest("arrival"), Earn(200)], next: Node("maren.hub")),
            (text: "We've done this before. Just point us at the work.",
             effects: [StartQuest("arrival"), Earn(200), Ending("skip")], next: Node("maren.skip")),
        ]),
        (id: "maren.skip", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Then you know how it goes. The borough's allowance is on your account, the board and the bench terminal are up on the Exchange square, and the trainers stand along the same row.",
         replies: [(text: "Thanks, Maren.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.hub", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "The borough's allowance is on your account. Ask what you need and I'll point you somewhere useful. There's another boat behind you.",
         replies: [
            (text: "What work is there for a household?", next: Node("maren.work")),
            (text: "Who runs things in Port Serein?", next: Node("maren.factions")),
            (text: "Where should we go first?", next: Node("maren.send")),
            (text: "We've done this before. Just point us at the work.",
             effects: [Ending("skip")], next: Node("maren.skip")),
        ]),
        (id: "maren.work", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "The board on the Exchange posts what's wanted, and the ground out there pays anyone who can read it. You've a bench of four at the terminal. Whoever's out does the work; the rest wait their turn.",
         replies: [
            (text: "Who runs things here?", next: Node("maren.factions")),
            (text: "Where should we go first?", next: Node("maren.send")),
        ]),
        (id: "maren.factions", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "{holder} holds the city and keeps the lights on, and will tell you so. I'm with {assembly}, the settlers speaking for themselves. Out in the basin, {keepers} count what's changing and want it slower.",
         replies: [
            (text: "What's that on the skyline?", next: Node("maren.city")),
            (text: "What work is there?", next: Node("maren.work")),
            (text: "Where should we go first?", next: Node("maren.send")),
        ]),
        (id: "maren.city", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "That's the processor. It keeps the basin breathing, and it was here before any of us. Port Serein grew up in its shadow, and I wouldn't live anywhere else.",
         replies: [
            (text: "What work is there?", next: Node("maren.work")),
            (text: "Where should we go first?", next: Node("maren.send")),
        ]),
        (id: "maren.send", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Dr Anouk Teague of {keepers} is up at the Exchange, and she needs someone with a steady hand. She's short with everyone, so don't take it to heart. Go and see her.",
         replies: [(text: "We'll go and find her.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.reminder", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "How's Teague treating you? She warms up once you've shown her something. The training ground is just past the terraces, if that's what she's after.",
         replies: [(text: "We're getting there.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.reminder_out", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Out to that old station of Teague's, are you? Mind the road past the yard. I'd like my settlers back in one piece.",
         replies: [(text: "We'll be careful.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.hears", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Word travels on the quay. You've the station's record, and you've met Wim Larrow. If the borough sees it first, we can put his channel before the council and make it lawful.",
         replies: [
            (text: "Take the record. The borough should settle Wim's water.",
             effects: [
                Ending("assembly"),
                Give("veyra:station.field_harvester", 1),
                Deed(Assembly, JobDone, 2),
                Deed(Keepers, Hurt, 1),
             ], next: Node("maren.closing")),
            (text: "We haven't decided who gets it yet.", next: End),
        ]),
        (id: "maren.hears_fallen", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Wim Larrow is dead, and the borough will want to know how. Give me the station's record and his channel goes before the council for his family.",
         replies: [
            (text: "Take the record. The borough should answer for Wim's family.",
             effects: [
                Ending("assembly"),
                Give("veyra:station.field_harvester", 1),
                Deed(Assembly, JobDone, 2),
                Deed(Keepers, Hurt, 1),
             ], next: Node("maren.closing_fallen")),
            (text: "We haven't decided who gets it yet.", next: End),
        ]),
        (id: "maren.closing_fallen", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Thank you. The council sits this week, and Wim's family will be heard. Here, a field harvester from the borough's stores: plant it on good ground and it works while you do.",
         replies: [(text: "Good luck with the council.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.closing", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Thank you. The council sits this week, and Wim will have his say. Here, a field harvester from the borough's stores: plant it on good ground and it works while you do.",
         replies: [(text: "Good luck with the council.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.selling", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Corin Hale's telling half the quay he's buying your station's record. I'd hoped the borough would see it first. Your choice, I suppose.",
         replies: [(text: "It was.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.after_own", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "The council passed Wim's channel, and his trees are greening again. He asked me to thank you. You'll always have a friend on this quay.",
         replies: [(text: "We're glad it went his way.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.after_own_fallen", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "The council heard Wim's family, and his orchard is being tended. It isn't the ending anyone wanted. You've a friend on this quay all the same.",
         replies: [(text: "We wish it had gone otherwise.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.after_own_shut", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "The council passed Wim's channel, but he lost half his orchard while the pump stood shut. He didn't ask me to thank you. I'll still say you did right by the borough.",
         replies: [(text: "We did what we thought best.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.after_keepers", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Teague published that record before the borough saw a page of it. I understand why you did it. I'd still have liked to be asked.",
         replies: [(text: "It needed to be public.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.after_holder", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "So the company has the station's record, and its own firmware on the mast. I hope they paid you well. Someone has to tell Wim, and it'll be me.",
         replies: [(text: "It was our call to make.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.after_holder_fallen", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "So the company has the station's record, and Wim Larrow is dead. His family will hear it from me, and they'll hear it kindly.",
         replies: [(text: "It was our call to make.", next: End)]),
        (id: "maren.after_skip", speaker: "veyra:person.maren_coyle",
         line: "Finding your own way, I see. Good. The board's on the Exchange if you need work, and I'm here if the city needs explaining.",
         replies: [(text: "Thanks, Maren.", next: End)]),
    ],
)
